{"url": "https://inclusive-components.design/about-the-project", "silo": "aria", "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n    <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\">\n\n    <title>About The Project</title>\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"\">\n\n    <meta name=\"HandheldFriendly\" content=\"True\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\n    <link rel=\"shortcut icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\">\n\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/assets/css/styles.css?v=89073ee017\">\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Miriam+Libre:700&amp;text=ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZabcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz%26\" rel=\"stylesheet\" media=\"all\" onload=\"if(media!='all')media='all'\">\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Asap:400,400i&amp;subset=latin\" rel=\"stylesheet\" media=\"all\" onload=\"if(media!='all')media='all'\">\n\n    <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"http://inclusive-components.design/about-the-project/\">\n    <meta name=\"referrer\" content=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\">\n    \n    <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Inclusive Components\">\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\">\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"About The Project\">\n    <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Let's use a question/answer format for this because it's easier. What is inclusive-components.design? A blog trying to be a pattern library, with a focus on inclusive design. Each post explores a common interface component and comes up with a better, more robust and accessible version of it. Why?\">\n    <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"http://inclusive-components.design/about-the-project/\">\n    <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary\">\n    <meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"About The Project\">\n    <meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Let's use a question/answer format for this because it's easier. What is inclusive-components.design? A blog trying to be a pattern library, with a focus on inclusive design. Each post explores a common interface component and comes up with a better, more robust and accessible version of it. Why?\">\n    <meta name=\"twitter:url\" content=\"http://inclusive-components.design/about-the-project/\">\n    <meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Written by\">\n    <meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"Heydon Pickering\">\n    \n    <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n    \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n    \"@type\": \"Article\",\n    \"publisher\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n        \"name\": \"Inclusive Components\",\n        \"logo\": \"http://inclusive-components.design/ghost/img/ghosticon.jpg\"\n    },\n    \"author\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Person\",\n        \"name\": \"Heydon Pickering\",\n        \"image\": \"//www.gravatar.com/avatar/1243c62e1667bbda61f130589811346e?s=250&d=mm&r=x\",\n        \"sameAs\": []\n    },\n    \"headline\": \"About The Project\",\n    \"url\": \"https://inclusive-components.design/about-the-project/\",\n    \"description\": \"Let&#x27;s use a question/answer format for this because it&#x27;s easier. What is inclusive-components.design? A blog trying to be a pattern library, with a focus on inclusive design. Each post explores a common interface component and comes up with a better, more robust and accessible version of it. Why?\",\n    \"mainEntityOfPage\": {\n        \"@type\": \"WebPage\",\n        \"@id\": \"http://inclusive-components.design\"\n    }\n}\n    </script>\n\n    <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"Ghost 0.11\">\n    <link rel=\"alternate\" type=\"application/rss+xml\" title=\"Inclusive Components\" href=\"https://inclusive-components.design/rss/\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <a href=\"#main\">skip to content</a>\n  <header role=\"banner\" class=\"reversed\">\n    <nav aria-label=\"site\">\n      <ul>\n        <li><a href=\"/\">Inclusive Components <span class=\"vh\">Home</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"/#components\">The components</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"/about-the-project\">About the project</a></li>\n      </ul>\n    </nav>\n\n    \n\n\n</header>\n\n<main id=\"main\" class=\"central\">\n  <h1>\n    About The Project\n  </h1>\n  <p>Let's use a question/answer format for this because it's easier.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"whatisbrinclusivecomponentsdesign\">What is <br>inclusive-components.design?</h2>\n\n<p>A blog trying to be a pattern library, with a focus on inclusive design. Each post explores a common interface component and comes up with a better, more robust and accessible version of it.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"why\">Why?</h2>\n\n<p>Because the web is full of interfaces which don't consider the diversity of abilities, circumstances, and preferences of their users.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"whatdoyoumeanbycomponent\">What do you mean by component?</h2>\n\n<p>A module, a part of your interface, an entry in your pattern library. A bit of what you make as a designer and developer.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"whatdoyoumeanbyinclusivedesign\">What do you mean by inclusive design?</h2>\n\n<p>I wrote <em><a href=\"https://24ways.org/2016/what-the-heck-is-inclusive-design/\">What The Heck Is Inclusive Design?</a></em> for <strong>24 Ways</strong> to answer that question.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"isthereabookaboutthiskindofthing\">Is there a book about this kind of thing?</h2>\n\n<p>I'm glad you asked. Yes, I wrote <em><a href=\"https://shop.smashingmagazine.com/products/inclusive-design-patterns\">Inclusive Design Patterns</a></em>.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"whoareyou\">Who are you?</h2>\n\n<p>I'm Heydon Pickering. If you <a href=\"https://hire.heydonworks.com/\">want to hire me, read this first</a>. I'm the accessibility editor for <a href=\"https://www.smashingmagazine.com/\">Smashing Magazine</a>. I've been building interfaces for the web for over 10 years.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"isthereatwitteraccounttofollow\">Is there a Twitter account to follow?</h2>\n\n<p>Yes! <a href=\"https://twitter.com/inclusicomps\">@inclusicomps</a>.</p>\n\n<div class=\"friends\">  \n  <h2 class=\"reversed\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">❤</span> Friends of @inclusicomps <span aria-hidden=\"true\">❤</span></h2>\n  <div>\n    <ul class=\"inline\">\n<li><a href=\"https://twitter.com/mfairchild365\">@mfairchild365</a></li>  \n<li><a href=\"https://twitter.com/kevtiq\">@kevtiq</a></li>  \n<li><a href=\"https://twitter.com/Long_Lazuli\">@Long_Lazuli</a></li>  \n<li><a href=\"https://twitter.com/laura_shields\">@laura_shields</a></li>  \n<li><a href=\"https://twitter.com/f_papado\">@f_papado</a></li>  \n<li><a href=\"https://twitter.com/marcospeebles\">@marcospeebles</a></li>  \n<li><a href=\"https://twitter.com/jina\">@jina</a></li>  \n<li><a href=\"https://twitter.com/invisionapp\">@invisionapp</a></li>  \n<li><a href=\"https://twitter.com/jina\">@jina</a></li>  \n<li><a href=\"https://twitter.com/2urface\">@2urface</a></li>  \n<li><a href=\"https://twitter.com/mrchrisadams\">@mrchrisadams</a></li>  \n<li><a href=\"https://twitter.com/AndyKKirk\">@AndyKKirk</a></li>  \n<li><a href=\"https://twitter.com/steverowling\">@steverowling</a></li>  \n<li><a href=\"https://twitter.com/gorghoa\">@gorghoa</a></li>  \n<li><a href=\"https://twitter.com/chrislaursen\">@chrislaursen</a></li>  \n<li><a href=\"https://twitter.com/oskarwestinTO\">@oskarwestinTO</a></li>  \n<li><a href=\"https://twitter.com/schofeld\">@schofeld</a></li>  \n<li><a href=\"https://twitter.com/kleinfreund\">@kleinfreund</a></li>  \n<li><a href=\"https://twitter.com/wcagtest\">@wcagtest</a></li>  \n<li><a href=\"https://twitter.com/bakkenbaeck\">@bakkenbaeck</a></li>  \n<li><a href=\"https://twitter.com/a11ycob\">@a11ycob</a></li>  \n<li><a href=\"https://twitter.com/IAmAdamTaylor\">@IAmAdamTaylor</a></li>  \n<li><a href=\"https://twitter.com/petervangrieken\">@petervangrieken</a></li>  \n<li><a href=\"https://twitter.com/webfactory\">@webfactory</a></li>  \n<li><a href=\"https://twitter.com/mdcpepper\">@mdcpepper</a></li>  \n<li><a href=\"https://twitter.com/hankchizljaw\">@hankchizljaw</a></li>  \n<li><a href=\"https://twitter.com/_ericthayer\">@_ericthayer</a></li>  \n<li><a href=\"https://twitter.com/zellwk\">@zellwk</a></li>  \n<li><a href=\"https://twitter.com/upstatement\">@upstatement</a></li>  \n<li><a href=\"https://twitter.com/scott_gruber\">@scott_gruber</a></li>  \n<li><a href=\"https://twitter.com/ShiftCph\">@ShiftCph</a></li>  \n     <li><a href=\"https://twitter.com/clearleft\">@clearleft</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://twitter.com/souporserious\">@souporserious</a></li>  \n      <li><a href=\"https://twitter.com/Kraig_Walker\">@Kraig_Walker</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"https://twitter.com/jshvgt\">@jshvgt</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"https://twitter.com/mattdistefano\">@mattdistefano</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://twitter.com/scottohara\">@scottohara</a></li>  \n<li><a href=\"https://twitter.com/huijkman\">@huijkman</a></li>  \n<li><a href=\"https://twitter.com/smarteru\">@smarteru</a></li>  \n    </ul>\n    <div class=\"friend-link smaller\">+ Your name here and a follow back for <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/inclusicomps\">$15 per article</a></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</main>\n\n\n\n    <footer class=\"central\">\n      <!--<div class=\"sponsors\">\n        <p>&mdash; Happily sponsored by &mdash;</p>\n        <div>\n          <a href=\"https://fronteers.nl/about\">\n            <img src=\"/assets/images/fronteers.svg?v=89073ee017\" alt=\"fronteers conference\">\n          </a>\n        </div>\n      </div>-->\n      <div class=\"site-meta\">\n        <p>Designed, built, and maintained by <a href=\"https://twitter.com/heydonworks\">Heydon Pickering</a>.</p>\n        <ul class=\"inline\">\n          <li><a href=\"/rss\"><img src=\"/assets/images/rss.svg?v=89073ee017\" alt=\"\"> Subscribe</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/inclusicomps\"><img src=\"/assets/images/patreon.svg?v=89073ee017\" alt=\"\